div.div:
optimizer::detect_letterbox(original) → LetterboxReport { kinds, bars, proxy, texture, keep }
Classifies each edge as Backdrop, FlatOther or Varied. An opposite pair FlatOther with the other pair Varied is flat padding bars. If the interior also reads as textured (T_TEXTURE_HIGHPASS), keep = the content rect. trim_letterbox() returns .keep.
Called from preprocessor::preprocess on the full-resolution original; stored in Prepared::letterbox. Wired: R1 reads it and hands the trimmed part to extend.rs. Two same-coloured bars read as backdrop and are not caught.
